# .dockerignore

# Directories
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/logs/
**/TestResults/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/node_modules/

# Files
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/.gitignore
**/.git/
**/README.md
**/LICENSE
**/*.md

# Test files
**/*Test.cs
**/*Tests.cs
**/test/
**/tests/

# Build artifacts
**/publish/
**/packages/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.cache
**/*.tmp

# OS generated files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*~
